OL,3,ACatalonia's former rebel president can
OL,4,Areturn to Spain, court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's Supreme Court has ruled the
OL,7,Fformer president of Catalonia, Carles
OL,8,FPuigdemont, can return without fear of
OL,9,Farrest nearly a decade after going into
OL,10,Fself-imposed exile having led a failed
OL,11,Findependence bid.
OL,13,FThe court upheld a decision to lift an
OL,14,Farrest warrant for him linked to the
OL,15,Freferendum his regional government
OL,16,Forganised in 2017, in defiance of
OL,17,FMadrid.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
