OL,3,ACatalonia's former rebel president can
OL,4,Areturn to Spain, court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FDirect rule was imposed on the region
OL,7,Fsoon after the vote and Puigdemont fled
OL,8,Fto Belgium, where he has been based
OL,9,Fever since - with a surprise appearance
OL,10,Fin Barcelona in 2024 prompting a police
OL,11,Fmanhunt.
OL,13,FBut the Spain to which he may return is
OL,14,Fmuch different from a decade ago, with
OL,15,FCatalan independence now a marginal
OL,16,Fpolitical issue.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
